import ../../helpers/driver.dl
import ../../../ui/source_buffers.dl
import ../../../ui/text_marks.dl

document editors:
    editor "Studio" containing "abc" using no UI appearance
    editor "River" containing "row" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of editors
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 600 by 400 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set labels to ["Studio", "River"]
set index to 0
loop while index < the length of labels:
    set editor to the UI source editor labeled (the item at index in labels) in workspace
    set main to editor's document
    set layout to the UI layout for element (editor's node) in (view's layout)
    restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in (the address of view)
    queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "!" in (the address of view)
    ignore update UI view (the address of view)
    synchronize UI source workspace workspace at 1.0 seconds
    set source to main's source
    set history to (the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s undo
    require condition (history != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit)) reporting "The main source edit was not undoable."
    set view's selection's anchor to 1
    set view's selection's caret to 3
    set layout's text scroll to 12.0
    set layout's scroll position to 35.0
    set imported to a UI source document named "helper.dl" at "file:///lib/helper.dl" containing "# helper\nπ means: 7" in (main's project)
    visit UI source document imported selecting 9 through 11 in editor in (the address of view)
    require condition ((editor's document = imported) and ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s text = imported's source)) reporting "Opening a definition did not display its source."
    require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 9) and (view's selection's caret = 11)) reporting "Opening a definition lost its UTF-8 selection."
    require condition ((the UI element (editor's node) accepts edits in window) = false) reporting "An imported source became editable."
    require condition ((the UI main source of editor in workspace at 2.0 seconds) = source) reporting "Running while viewing an import selected the imported source."
    set state to the UI text state for main in editor in window
    mark UI text source in state
    add UI text mark (UI ink 80 150 100) from 0 to 1 with opacity 100 in state
    require condition ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s marks = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text mark)) reporting "An execution mark for the main source appeared in an imported view."
    queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "bad" in (the address of view)
    ignore update UI view (the address of view)
    require condition ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s text = imported's source) reporting "Text input modified a read-only imported source."
    require condition (go back in UI source editor editor in (the address of view)) reporting "The definition visit did not retain its origin."
    require condition ((editor's document = main) and ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s undo = history)) reporting "Returning from an import lost the main source history."
    require condition ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s marks != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text mark)) reporting "Returning from an import lost execution marks applied to the main source."
    require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 1) and (view's selection's caret = 3)) reporting "Returning from an import lost the main source selection."
    require condition ((layout's text scroll = 12.0) and (layout's scroll position = 35.0)) reporting "Returning from an import lost the main source scroll."
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
    ignore update UI view (the address of view)
    require condition ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s text = (the substring of source from 1 spanning 3 bytes)) reporting "Returning from an import changed the undo operation."
    visit UI source document imported selecting 9 through 11 in editor in (the address of view)
    replace UI main source of editor in workspace with "new main" at 3.0 seconds
    require condition ((main's source = "new main") and ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s text = imported's source)) reporting "Replacing the main source overwrote the imported view."
    require condition (go back in UI source editor editor in (the address of view)) reporting "Replacing the main source discarded navigation history."
    require condition (((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s text = "new main") and ((the UI value for (editor's node) in window)'s undo = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit))) reporting "Replacing an inactive source retained old text or undo history."
    require condition ((go back in UI source editor editor in (the address of view)) = false) reporting "Navigation retained an already-consumed location."
    increment index
free UI source workspace workspace
close the address of view
close window
print line "Studio and embedded source views preserve per-file history, selection, scrolling and main-project actions."
